import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 935 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 1 | The Increment-Development Iron Law","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 935 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 1 | The Increment-Development Iron Law","no":935,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 1","Increment Development","Anti-Predation","Energy Cycle"],"related":["15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","934-Heavenly-Dao-Rules General Introduction"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0935_模块5-规则一-增量开发铁律.md","filePath":"en/0935_模块5-规则一-增量开发铁律.md"}'),a={name:"en/0935_模块5-规则一-增量开发铁律.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-935-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-1-the-increment-development-iron-law" tabindex="-1">Entry 935 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 1 | The Increment-Development Iron Law <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-935-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-1-the-increment-development-iron-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 935 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 1 | The Increment-Development Iron Law&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 04 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-power-s-first-legitimate-source-is-new-creation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: power&#39;s first legitimate source is &quot;new creation&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-power-s-first-legitimate-source-is-new-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: power&#39;s first legitimate source is &quot;new creation&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules&#39; thirty-one, the first must answer &quot;where should cultivators obtain power.&quot; The old cosmos&#39;s default answer is zero-sum — you gain one more, others lose one more, so killing, devouring, and preying become the only evolutionary shortcut. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Heavenly-Dao answer is: all energy and law amplification needed for cultivation must first come from the cosmos&#39;s inherently increment-developable part, not from slicing a chunk off stock distribution. This is the Increment-Development Iron Law; it is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s first cornerstone at the energy layer.</p><p>The six top-level axioms simultaneously activate here: the anti-predation axiom directly requires &quot;develop increments, consume no stock&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races ensures increments&#39; dividends are shared by Myriad Ranks, not monopolized by the strong; the collective-ascension axiom makes the increment project itself the heavenly ladder lifting Myriad Ranks; the causal self-discipline axiom requires increment development not disturb existing causal chains; the law-first axiom lets &quot;increment&quot;&#39;s definition, measurement, and boundary be nailed first by law, never changing for plot convenience.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-what-counts-as-increment" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: What Counts as &quot;Increment&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-what-counts-as-increment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: What Counts as &quot;Increment&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Iron Law&#39;s content breaks into three executable criteria:</p><ol><li><strong>Free energy the cosmos may inherently develop, law nodes not yet lit, and space-laws that may be remade</strong> are regarded as increments and developed first;</li><li><strong>Stock energy and established achievements already belonging to some being, civilization, or planet consciousness</strong> may not be extracted, transferred, or nibbled under any name;</li><li><strong>The same energy flow may only &quot;create one direction once&quot;</strong>: after the developer gains increment returns, that direction must be registered in the Alaya Network as &quot;symbiotic benefit&quot;; secondary resale for profit is forbidden.</li></ol><p>Take the three origin bases: the deduction-iteration system (001) develops law blanks in the cosmos not yet exhausted by deduction; the life-cycle system (002) develops life energy that self-generates and self-grows; the space-law scheduling system (003) schedules unoccupied space positions — all three are increments, none extracts stock.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-the-cosmos-can-afford-everyone-taking-increments" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why the Cosmos Can Afford &quot;Everyone Taking Increments&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis-why-the-cosmos-can-afford-everyone-taking-increments" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis: Why the Cosmos Can Afford &quot;Everyone Taking Increments&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Increment development is not moral beautification, but a physical fact proven by the Energy Cycle and Transformation Law (Document 15) and the Multiplication-Fruit technologized principle (Document 16):</p><ul><li>The cosmic-law network contains massive &quot;unlit nodes&quot; whose energy reserves far exceed all beings&#39; current total consumption;</li><li>Deduction iteration may multiply research efficiency (Multiplication Fruit has been technologized into hundredfold deduction amplification), turning &quot;time&quot; itself into an increment;</li><li>The anchor-origin feedback cycle (Document 25) amplifies each correctly developed increment, via the Myriad-Rank-origin bidirectional cycle, into whole-system benefit.</li></ul><p>The old cosmos was forced to prey because it treated the cosmos as a fixed-size pie; Heavenly-Dao Rule 1 points out: the cosmos is a wok that grows its own dough.</p><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism-how-increments-are-identified-registered-allocated" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism: How Increments Are Identified, Registered, Allocated <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism-how-increments-are-identified-registered-allocated" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism: How Increments Are Identified, Registered, Allocated&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The anchor network real-time draws the &quot;unlit-law map,&quot; publicly listing developable increments to all beings, free to claim;</li><li>Development projects are compensated per contracted-responsibility more-work-more-pay; increment returns are shared by the developer and the civilizational community he belongs to;</li><li>Before any development action starts, the Alaya Network automatically verifies: does the energy used come from the increment pool? Does it touch the stock red line? Touching freezes it;</li><li>The 20% activation strategy (Document 23) ensures increment-development resources first flow to the 80% not yet initiated, rather than continuing to feed the already strong.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation-what-happens-when-stock-is-treated-as-increment" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation: What Happens When Stock Is Treated as Increment <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation-what-happens-when-stock-is-treated-as-increment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation: What Happens When Stock Is Treated as Increment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: unknowingly misusing stock energy, forced rollback and compensatory development of equal increments, no original sin pursued;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: knowingly violating, under the name of &quot;developing increments&quot; actually extracting some clan&#39;s stock, has law-anchor permissions frozen and is transferred into Entry 960&#39;s enlightened-predator conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: systematically draining some plane&#39;s or planet consciousness&#39;s stock energy to manufacture cyclical harvesting, is isolated and tried under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure.</li></ul><p>Rule 1&#39;s sanction logic is &quot;restore original + make up increments,&quot; not destruction — the goal is to guide the astray energy flow back into the symbiotic cycle.</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Supervision has four parties: Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision automatically marks energy flow as the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee does quarterly audits of the increment list and stock red line as the second layer; the extracted party (planet consciousness, weak clan) may directly file Heavenly-Dao litigation with the Symbiotic Court as the third layer; the Anchor Council interprets &quot;increment&quot; definition and prevents the rule from being technically evaded as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: locking the development object to &quot;unlit nodes&quot; eliminates mutual-destruction-style internal friction from fighting over stock</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cutting off predation&#39;s necessity at the energy source — since increments are infinite, predation has no &quot;survival necessity&quot; excuse; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems allocate cosmic resources as private property, with the strong monopolizing increment entrances; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s increment list is network-wide public, the weak claim first</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: increment-development qualification is open to Myriad Ranks 99%; plant spirits, planet consciousness, and consciousness-information clans all have dedicated increment maps</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: newly incorporated multiverse residual civilizations automatically gain increment-access channels, no limit by civilization age</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Iron Law answers civilizational finalization&#39;s first question: where does power come from. The answer is &quot;newly made, not stolen.&quot; With the source correct, the following thirty-one rules have roots.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/934_模块5-天道规则总论-天道规则终极定型.html">Entry 934 · Heavenly-Dao-Rules General Introduction</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/936_模块5-规则二-不消耗存量铁律.html">Entry 936 · Rule 2 No-Consumption-of-Stock Iron Law</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
